  "forAnalyst": "Visual page building in Builder.io, with the result rendered by the Virto storefront.",
  "forArchitect": "A CMS bridge: no storage, two dependencies plus one optional, two settings and four permissions. Its name in the registry — \"Builder.io\" — is one of the few titles that is already correct.",
